<title>ITALY: Bids for Italy's Seat must be by end-June.</title>
<headline>Bids for Italy's Seat must be by end-June.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final bids from three consortiums for Italian phone directory publisher Seat, which is up for privatisation, must be made by the end of June, the Italian Treasury said.</p>
<p>The Treasury said once the sale contract was signed and the deal approved by the relevant authorities, the shares would be transferred and the bid winner would be required to make a public offer to buy ordinary shares on the market.</p>
</text>
